/* DIM — warm graphite, and that is the whole point. Dim used to be Dark at a
   higher brightness, which gave nobody a reason to reach for it. It is now the
   warm room in the set: --tint lifts warm, the ground carries a low-chroma
   brown cast, and --shade casts the shadows in it rather than in black. */
