/* The suggested topic, printed loud on purpose. The stops were four raw hex
   literals picked against the dark canvas, and three of the four failed there
   too (#ef4444 4.15:1, #3b82f6 4.25:1, #a855f7 3.95:1 at 16.32px — bold, but
   under the 18.66px that would let 3:1 apply). They are now the four --ink-*
   tokens for those same hues, which flip with the theme: 5.65–7.27:1 on the
   canvas, 5.36–5.40:1 on the sheet. Same four colours, same order. */
