/* ── The homeowner's own page, in their contractor's colour ──────────────────
   Every --cbrand-* below falls back to the platform orange, so an account with
   an unreadable accent renders exactly as it always did. Only the button's
   label is a contrast decision and brandPaint computes it — see
   lib/contractor-brand. */
.client-hero-title {
