/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   ACCOUNT / PLAN COLOR SYSTEM.

   The active tab and hero already carried the brand orange, but every surface
   below them resolved to the same navy card with the same grey edge. The page
   was therefore colourful at the top and visually flat everywhere a decision
   was made. These accents identify sections by purpose while leaving copy,
   forms, checkout behavior and status semantics unchanged.

   Theme-aware ink tokens supply every accent. They deliberately become darker
   on the light theme, so borders and glyphs do not wash out on white.
   --------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
.settings-shell {
  position: relative;
  isolation: isolate;
}

